# Class: <http://example.org/A> (<http://example.org/A>)

EquivalentClasses(Annotation(rdfs:comment "copied target") <http://example.org/A> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://example.org/B> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://example.org/p> <http://example.org/C>)))
